錯，冰鎮令到個皮可以keep住脆，啱啱上菜嘅時候外凍內暖，不過好快就連裡面D肉都凍埋！個粉漿好薄，肉質嫩滑多汁，個味道都唔錯，同其它地","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0crZ101"},{"full":"https://static7.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/34/2GRC/0HJ6HM8D17729EF05DD789px.jpg","time":"2026-08-30T01:46:51+08:00","caption":"呢個係佢地嘅招牌菜當然要試啦，我見都有好多人食，佢嘅賣點係已經剝曬殼，size都唔算細，食起上黎淡淡肉就真係好方便嘅，味道就正正常常無乜特別，值得讚嘅係佢無一層","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0cbZ101"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/33/2FRZ/0HC6ZL09CA210EBD998B41px.jpg","time":"2026-07-11T20:59:21+08:00","caption":"【深水埗地道聚腳點】高高酒家：生日聚餐首選！ 最近又約了一班老友記去深水埗「高高酒家」聚餐兼慶祝生日，氣氛真的超級好！🎉 這裡絕對是跟朋友「吹水」的好地方，夠熱","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0OLzU01"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/32/2FMP/0HB5HD88A749237F054CF9px.jpg","time":"2026-07-02T21:54:28+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0WQ6x01"},{"full":"https://static5.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/32/2FMP/0HB5HC89D1A85E6877D5B9px.jpg","time":"2026-07-02T21:54:28+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0WA6x01"},{"full":"https://static8.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/32/2FMP/0HB5HB08E9D95E308CD6A5px.jpg","time":"2026-07-02T21:54:28+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0Vw6x01"},{"full":"https://static7.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/32/2FMP/0HB5HA5894EA5B8C12D85Apx.jpg","time":"2026-07-02T21:54:28+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0Vg6x01"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/32/2FMP/0HB5H9581534891259B834px.jpg","time":"2026-07-02T21:54:28+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0VQ6x01"},{"full":"https://static5.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/32/2FMP/0HB5H8AD1E537FE59E6D24px.jpg","time":"2026-07-02T21:54:28+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0VA6x01"},{"full":"https://static8.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/32/2FMP/0HB5H7BBD54144EFD34BBApx.jpg","time":"2026-07-02T21:54:28+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0Uw6x01"},{"full":"https://static7.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/32/2FMP/0HB5H62009EEF2613C78F9px.jpg","time":"2026-07-02T21:54:28+08